      "content": "wait, did you just say \"goblins\" in the email draft? i definitely can't send that to my boss lol. that's a bit too weird. can we strip all the fantasy/metaphor stuff out and just keep it strictly corporate? also, can you finish the email? i need it to be really firm about the fact that these little things are undermining the original plan, but without actually being crazier than this.",
